# The displacement variant (log 2026-09-11): past 3,000 samples the
# champion's own raid party (size 3, extractor raiding, adopted with
# the champion) is retasked at remembered enemy FACTORIES. Composition
# answers to the attrition regime are 0-for-4 with mechanisms verified
# (hover, tempo, gate, dose); this stops mirroring the standoff line
# and strikes what BUILDS it. At Very Hard the 1.8x subsidy funds no
# income floor -- the Impossible proportional-and-bounded verdict does
# not carry down -- so a killed factory stays killed at our refill
# rate, not theirs. One field off the champion (raze 3000).
